    "content": "<p>Join the <dfn class=\"onomasticon onomasticon-cursor-help\" title=\"Internet Governance Forum A UN-convened multistakeholder forum for Internet and digital policy dialogue. Its discussions inform policymaking; the Forum does not negotiate binding decisions. \">IGF</dfn> <dfn class=\"onomasticon onomasticon-cursor-help\" title=\"Multistakeholder Advisory Group The Secretary-General-appointed advisory group that helps shape the IGF programme and schedule, including evaluating workshop proposals and supporting the preparatory process. \">MAG</dfn> Chair Office Hours for an open discussion and live Q&amp;A session with the Chair and other community members. View the agenda and register for each session <a href=\"https://www.intgovforum.org/sites/default/files/2026-09/MAG%20Chair%20Office%20Hours.pdf\"><strong>here</strong></a>!</p>",
